{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>現年24歲郭珮文（Juliana）於2023年參選香港小姐成功打入五強，雖然最後與獎項無緣，但憑著傲人上圍被網民封為新一代「最強Body」俘虜大批粉絲，成為話題女王。郭珮文深知自己的流量密碼，經常在社交平台大方分享吸睛性感相，昨晚（22日）郭珮文再度發功，看似密實的鬆身T恤原來內有乾坤，暗暗曬出完美S型沙漏身材，非常吸睛！</p><figure><img alt=\"由參選港姐至今，郭珮文的出眾身材一直都是焦點。（資料圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250918/1045383336517701632952061.jpeg/oKqyRxOuoniUgliBrWfyX-rw1yeRDQent0iJabdIiWk\"/><figcaption>由參選港姐至今，郭珮文的出眾身材一直都是焦點。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"郭珮文擁有完美身段。（ig@julianakpm）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260612/1142177722341003264075918.jpeg/zGEPuvemhrnkLrble2tC2UsXwTaZXCtqqyvWyKsr1sg\"/><figcaption>郭珮文擁有完美身段。（ig@julianakpm）</figcaption></figure><p>郭珮文密實造型帖文內暗藏性感照</p><p>郭珮文連日來在IG分享了外遊的照片，昨晚曬出多張穿上密實中袖T恤及銀色長褲的照片，不過深知流量密碼的郭珮文當然不會令大家失望。她在多張照片中分別曬出兩張另一穿搭的靚相，另一造型她穿上V領T恤，不過透薄的材質及超貼身的剪裁將其豐滿的上圍表露無遺。期間她更將翹起雙手露出纖腰，大曬完美S曲線。</p><figure><img alt=\"透薄的材質及超貼身的剪裁將郭珮文豐滿的上圍表露無遺。（IG/@julianakpm）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260623/1146044301793693696407238.jpeg/spW87uqSHb7ezhSgYanxllSjkK3J7g6nlaFd9ZWhXfU\"/><figcaption>透薄的材質及超貼身的剪裁將郭珮文豐滿的上圍表露無遺。（IG/@julianakpm）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"側身曬火辣S曲線。（IG/@julianakpm）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260623/1146044299008544768238604.jpeg/Q9BO640w_W2hQ3_nBR4XC2FQvHf3lMoLwzyW9MM8lvQ\"/><figcaption>側身曬火辣S曲線。（IG/@julianakpm）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"郭珮文連日來在IG分享了外遊的照片。（IG/@julianakpm）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260623/1146044295933988864735819.jpeg/TcG8LNI8-16O2vXugTqw4W1SazIzjZsbm0rZ1ZtK2dU\"/><figcaption>郭珮文連日來在IG分享了外遊的照片。（IG/@julianakpm）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"郭珮文五官標緻。（IG/@julianakpm）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260623/1146044292989456384218956.jpeg/KizOTtPMyD3oSDan6dKE7w_FV4w4VC4y7_TBT-_0wU8\"/><figcaption>郭珮文五官標緻。（IG/@julianakpm）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"郭珮文。（ig@julianakpm）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260612/1142178031213744128658419.jpeg/_3LC1EtIRktl-FN_vld7nEuScJ_OU80f3U7XLt1O1y4\"/><figcaption>郭珮文。（ig@julianakpm）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"郭珮文。（ig@julianakpm）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260612/1142178033533325312632950.jpeg/14MWl9WgwSkCRFY_JoGb8y_4_RsrJpElx4hXEseIVxI\"/><figcaption>郭珮文。（ig@julianakpm）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"郭珮文。（ig@julianakpm）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260612/1142178035806769152593682.jpeg/cJRPp28YMGPnRtC_QZEkOMrC2Vc_uhLd-bGtoPmxraA\"/><figcaption>郭珮文。（ig@julianakpm）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"郭珮文。（ig@julianakpm）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260612/1142178038155710464195468.jpeg/9QZOao6DQDx4riFROqsQn-H9keD2W1NnkP1bvpD9W74\"/><figcaption>郭珮文。（ig@julianakpm）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"郭珮文。（ig@julianakpm）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260612/1142178040768892928680913.jpeg/OwcdbNCdgKCnmFXtzGbLw26KJCb87RopuzYkyrs2JMo\"/><figcaption>郭珮文。（ig@julianakpm）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"郭珮文。（ig@julianakpm）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260612/1142178030853033984059128.png/IIovL1NP-w0FcXPMc6Mv2b2ZPZyzEGM7d45_WXeOf1k\"/><figcaption>郭珮文。（ig@julianakpm）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"郭珮文。（ig@julianakpm）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260612/1142178033189392384647321.png/1Unt6uA-Za-4vC4mCi21RYYcsmQbbtkKLuFthi7hbYY\"/><figcaption>郭珮文。（ig@julianakpm）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-23T05:43:00.774911+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":648,"images":13,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}